window.products.push({"id":278056,"name":"Makhry 4pcs Door Draft Stopper 37 Inches Under Door Noise Blocker Adjustable Door Bottom Seal Strip Draft Guard for Door(Grey)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D8iB8ZF6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Double-sided foam: Under door draft blocker is designed with double-sided foam, more effictive to reduces light, smells and noise and, keep your room clean and quite. Cost-effective: Door air blocker can be washable for long time reuses. It can be can be washed by machine or hand. Non-slip: Under door sound blocker can be fixed with the door, won't slide out with the opening and closing of the door. No need extra time to re-position. Large size foam: 4pcs smell proof door seal, each 37 inch in length and 3.93 inch in width, can be cut according to door with different size. Easy to install: Cut door light blocker as required, and slide it under the door. Then it can work for you by conserving your air conditioning or blocking the cold air from outside.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D8iB8ZF6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Makhry","source_asin":"B08TBVQBV3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-278056","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TBVQBV3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TBVQBV3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":278057,"name":"Moscow Mule Copper Mugs | 16oz Copper Cups for Cocktail -100% Pure Copper Moscow Mule Mug Gifts (1 piece)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rpwYn3VLL._AC_.jpg","description":"1x Moscow Mule Copper Mug 16oz Copper Cup : GUAAFA copper mugs are not only authentic but also safe. It went through a comprehensive third party safety and quality tests to make sure that it is food safe. Because we want you to 100% enjoy your Moscow Mule without worries. 100% FOOD SAFE & PURE COPPER – JUST LIKE THE ORIGINAL 1941 MULE MASTER CRAFTSMEN – NO TWO ARE THE SAME :- This HANDMADE 16 oz (500ml) copper mugs are handcrafted & designed by craftsmen using a unique method that has been in use for hundreds of years to provide a solid, comfortable grip and a smooth lip feels for the best drinking experience. Every copper mug is carefully hand-hammered, so each glass is one of a kind. Our Moscow mule copper mugs are made from the best materials and the highest quality to produce the best mugs you deserve. Take Care of YOUR MOSCOW MULE Copper Cups :- It is highly recommended to hand wash to keep the plating surface perfect. Using dishwasher may speed up the wearing of the copper plating surface due to the severe detergent reaction. Copper vessels when stocked for some days may develop black spots due to oxidation of copper. This is a natural process. 100% Pure Copper Mule Mugs are Perfect gift for Men & women, Him & her, Adult & teen Boys & Girls on Birthday, Baptism, Communion, Confirmation, Christmas, Thanks Giving, Easter, Halloween, New Year, Valentine & Wedding Anniversary Ceremonial Celebrations & drinkware. Nordic , Rustic Gifts for Him & her :- Perfect gift for husband & boyfriend from Wife or Girlfriend, A unique gift for Father in Law, Brother in Law, Step Dad, Grandpa, Grandma, Adult Son, War Veteran Friend, Army , Airforce, Marine, Navy Dad , Brother, Father or Husband. Bar , Pubs, Club & restaurant Ceremonial Drinkware :- Guaafa Moscow mule cups & mugs are perfect to serve the special cocktail in pubs, bars, restaurants , hotels & motels. If you own one and plan to have a traditional rustic norse goblet - a 100% copper Moscow mule mug will be perfect.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rpwYn3VLL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GUAAFA","source_asin":"B0B54Q7CCL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-278057","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B54Q7CCL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B54Q7CCL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
