window.products.push({"id":278150,"name":"Bartnelli extreem Stability Ironing Board (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HrYQ4IEPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When you are looking to invest in an ironing board, you might as well want to get one that makes your life easier. The Bartnelli does just that. With the great quality & features of the ironing board it helps you have a better experience while ironing .Plus this ironing board adds style to your laundry room!! With a purchases of Bartnelli you get the one you were looking for: Type/Size 51x19 inches large generous ironing surface for regular ironing, quilting, knitting and tablecloths! Height More than one person will use the ironing board? No problem! This ironing board is designed to be adjustable, that users can lower and raise as needed to 4 different heights (30 - 38 inches) depending on the height of the user! Padding and Cover 100% cotton extra thick pad board cover and is supported by foam work best for withstanding heat and keeping clothes from sticking! Metal, mesh top that will allow steam to pass through and evaporate! Extras ☑ Enjoy the big sized iron & steam generator rest ☑ Includes wheels for easy transport ☑ When not in use, the product folds down flat for easy storage.  ☑ Iron rest prevents the iron from falling off the board  ☑ The metal of the ironing board is anti-corrosion.  ☑ Safety lock prevents the ironing board accidentally collapsing  ☑ The lock keeps it closed during storage.  ☑ Protective feet help shield floors from scratches. Bartnelli confidently offers a 3 year warranty for this ironing board!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! Click add to cart now to enjoy a fantastically smooth ironing","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HrYQ4IEPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bartnelli","source_asin":"B01NA9JWSL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-278150","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NA9JWSL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NA9JWSL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":278151,"name":"Hagen-Renaker Ceramic Monkey 00414","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913prAELqoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"John and Maxine Renaker started Hagen-Renaker in their garage in Culver City in the latter part of 1945. John Renaker set up the first kiln by running a garden hose from the family's gas stove. Maxine Renaker was the first designer and salesperson. After successfully selling their first pieces, they found they could not produce them. John Renaker's Mom, Moss Renaker, worked for a pottery in Monrovia called Walker Potteries. Her boss, Joe Walker, agreed to teach John about the pottery business. Maxine's Dad, Ole Hagen, agreed to build the young couple their first factory. Ole who was a carpenter by trade, went to Oregon to get a load of lumber at wholesale cost, and he and his brother, Arne worked every weekend for months to build a combination factory and apartment. In gratitude, John and Maxine named their new company Hagen-Renaker. On Easter Sunday, 1946, the family and their fledgling company moved to Monrovia. The company first produced elaborately decorated plates and butter pats and shadow boxes. They were selling well, but there were difficulties with them related to firing and shipping. John Renaker noticed a small duck that Maxine had on her work bench. She was a Camp Fire Girl leader, and she had designed it for the kids. He saw potential in it and put it on the bottom of the company's order sheet. When he saw how it sold, he decided to change direction and produce small figurines. Very soon they had transformed Helen Perrin from a decorator into a designer, and she was joined by others. John and Maxine were able to recognize artistic excellence and based their business on these talented designers. This tradition and continues it today. Maureen Love Calvert and Helen Perrin Farnlund are still providing a majority of the new items to the line and have been joined by Bob McGuinness and Kathleen Ellis. (*This text is from the official Hagen-Renaker website.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913prAELqoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hagen-Renaker","source_asin":"B00QMVTB7E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-278151","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00QMVTB7E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00QMVTB7E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":278152,"name":"GALLERY SOLUTIONS 8x10 Flat Ash Wood Wall Picture Frame with White Mat For 5x7 Image","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91O8Em9snLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GALLERY SOLUTIONS 8x10 Flat Ash Wood Wall Picture Frame with White Mat For 5x7 Image Add some rustic vintage charm to your decor with Gallery Solutions 8x10 Flat Ash Wood Wall Picture Frame with White Mat For 5x7 Image. Crafted from durable solid wood, this frame is washed and aged to give a warm country feel. The crisp white mat is precut to frame a 5 inch x 7 inch image or remove it to frame an 8 inch x 10 inch image without the mat. This frame includes durable hangers on the back of the frame to hang on your wall, either horizontally or vertically. Making it easy for you to showcase your most cherished photos, beautifully. Our Gallery Solutions Flat Ash Wood Wall Picture Frame holds a 5 inch x 7 inch image with the white mat and measures 8 inches x 10 inches without the mat. A perfect addition to any home decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91O8Em9snLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gallery Solutions","source_asin":"B07BRF9TFM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-278152","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BRF9TFM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BRF9TFM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
