window.products.push({"id":278293,"name":"Blended Waxes, Inc. Bottle Sealing Wax 1 lb. Pastilles - Resilient and Versatile Bottling Wax For Wine, Beer, and Liquor Bottle Sealing - Seals Betwee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jYBuBtbIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium wax blend: Wax pastilles are developed to seal all kinds of containers: wine, liquor, perfumes, syrups, oils and more. Provides a strong, flexible coating that opens easily without cracking or crumbling. Protects against air and moisture that can cause spoilage to bottle contents. Formula will give your packaging a distinct look. Wax can be embossed with a logo or monogram for customization. Indirect food compliant. Approx. melt 170°F; dip 250°F. Thin at 275°F; thicken at 225°F. Diverse Options: Our wide range of wax products caters to a variety of applications, such as candle making, food coatings, wood & leather care, therapeutic use, and more. We offer natural waxes, microcrystalline wax, and paraffin wax, among others. Industry Expertise: Experienced technicians focus on providing consistent, top-quality waxes with processes that have been mastered by the company for over 40 years. Blended Waxes’ expansive product collection will satisfy all of your wax needs be it for personal, trade or industrial purposes. Quality and product clarification: A variety of standards and certifications are met to ensure the wax blends meet the highest specifications. Blended Waxes product testing is done to the requirements set forth by the American Society of Testing and Materials. Blended Waxes, Inc. manufacturing processes are certified by the International Organization for Standardization ISO 9001-2015. You can count on top-quality in every batch. Made in the USA: All paraffin, microcrystalline and natural waxes are sourced domestically. All the finished products are also manufactured, lab-tested, and certified in the United States.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jYBuBtbIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BW Blended Waxes, Inc.","source_asin":"B0C4QP9R99","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-278293","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4QP9R99","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4QP9R99","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
