window.products.push({"id":278415,"name":"LFF Atomic Clock 4.5\" Numbers, Digital Atomic Wall Clock Never Needs Setting, Indoor Outdoor Temperature with Wireless Outdoor Sensor, Battery Powered","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Mr8QOicKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👍 Accurate Atomic Clock- The atomic clock has a built-in receiver that automatically synchronizes itself with the WWVB radio broadcast by the US Government’s National Institute (NIST) in Fort Collins, Colorado. Digital wall clock adjusts time & calendar to atomic signal automatically, and could count seconds accurately. (Note: No Backlight Display) 👍 15\" LCD HD Display- The digital atomic clock has an upgraded large LCD screen with easy to read 4.5\" high numbers. It displays the calendar, time (12/24H), day of the week, alarm and indoor/outdoor temperature (°C/°F). The clock can be used as a wall clock or desk clock and is friendly to the elderly or visually impaired. 6 time zones are available: EST, CST, MST, PST, AKT, HST. 👍 Atomic Clocks with Indoor Outdoor Temperature- The clock has built-in high-quality indoor temperature and humidity sensors (included) that transmit accurate measurements of outdoor temperature and humidity in °F or °C to the atomic wall clock. The sensor transmission range is up to 330 feet (100 meters), and the outdoor waterproof rating is IPX4, splash-proof. For the sensor, place the device in an open area away from direct rain, and you can easily understand the temperature and humidity both indoors and outdoors. 👍 Battery Operated Digital Clock- Atomic clock indoor outdoor temperature is powered by 4 AA batteries (not included), the wireless outdoor sensor is powered by 2 AAA batteries (not included). It has simple manual setting buttons, easy to set, easy to read, easy to use. They are excellent clocks for seniors, and functional and stylish design makes it a perfect decor to kitchen, living room, bedroom, library, and office use. 🎁 Perfect Gift- Large digital wall clock has 3 hanging holes and a bracket, it can not only be placed on the desktop but also can be hung on the wall. Practical and stylish modern design, perfect gift for parents, friends on birthday, new year, thanksgiving, christmas and anniversaries. If there is any quality problem, please contact us in time. (Get: 1×Atomic Clock; 1×Outdoor Sensor; 1×Manual)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Mr8QOicKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LFF","source_asin":"B0BN1FXC4R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-278415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN1FXC4R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN1FXC4R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
