window.products.push({"id":278422,"name":"FITHOME Small Insulated Lunch Bags for Women, Leakproof Lunch Box for Women and men, Reusable Thermal Lunch Tote Cooler, Adults Fashion Lunch Bags for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x2Ibi-2cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Fashionable Design】Fithome lunch bag is designed by our senior designer so it has been deeply loved by young people because of its unique appearance. There are two pockets on two sides of the stylish women's lunch bag and one with a zipper, which is perfect for storing personal belongings such as a wallet, phone, headphones, or keys. We have 5 different colors, it is suitable for any occasion like office/park/friends' home, etc. NOTE: THIS ITEM IS NOT INTENDED FOR USE BY CHILDREN 12 AND UNDER. 【Keep Fresh & Warm】Insulated lunch bag can keep your food stay warm as well as your fruit stay fresh. We have designed three-layer, the outer layer of Oxford fabric is made of waterproof so it can protect the inside of the freezable lunch bag, the middle layer is thickened EPE foam so it has buffer protection, and the inner layer is made of premium aluminum foil(BPA Free). 【Easy to Clean】Because of the Oxford fabric's outer layer, it is waterproof so you can remove dirt easily and quickly. The inner layer can also be cleaned easily by wiping with a towel, moreover, the lunch bags are leakproof. If the soup or drinks pour out from the lunch container accidentally, don't worry because they won't leak out from our adult lunch bags. Take the broken container out from the lunch bag and clean it with a dry towel so you can use it again, it is convenient for adults. 【Wide Range of Use】This lunch bag is lightweight and portable. The lunch bag looks small but with its large capacity, it could perfectly fit your lunchbox, snacks, and drinks. You can use it as a reusable lunch bag, or grocery bag. This stylish lunch box is suitable for a variety of occasions, including office, travel, work, and college, picnics. It is also suitable for all groups including women, men, and adults. 【Lightweight & Large Capacity】 Lunch bag is 8.66×6.29×8.66 inches large, there is enough space for you to carry things. You can take lunch box/fruits/drinks all in one lunch bag on work days, and if you want to go picnic with your families, our large lunch tote can meet all your needs and it really can be a good helper. You also can use lunch bags to carry drinks to the beach in summer, not only because of their big capacity but also because they can keep food and drinks cold for hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x2Ibi-2cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FITHOME","source_asin":"B0C1NL2BT1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-278422","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1NL2BT1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1NL2BT1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
