window.products.push({"id":278604,"name":"RENPHO H13 HEPA Air Purifier for Home Large Room 330 SQ.FT, Air Purifier for Allergies and Pets, Air Cleaner for Office Kitchen, Eliminate Odors Smoke","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NhrJhJvQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed to cover up to 990 square feet--With a CADR rate of 147 CFM (250 m³/h), this air purifier circulates air in rooms up to 990 sq.ft (90 m²) in one hour, the ideal size for a living room, family room, master bedroom, or large office. There’s no harmful Ozone, ideal for anyone especially children and asthma sufferers helpful for everyone especially for the children and asthma sufferers Advanced 5 stages Filtration System--Comes with 4 filters: washable pre-filters, charcoal filter, activated carbon filter with intercept bacteria coating, and true HEPA filter. Effectively eliminates 99.97% of airborne pollutants like pet dander, dust, smoke, pollen, allergens, odors and particles as small as 0.3 microns. Independent replacement indicator for each filter, allows you to replace each filter without replacing the entire set, making it convenient and economical (RP-AP002 filters) Smart Air Quality Monitor: With a built-in smart air quality sensor, set the air purifier to auto mode, it can detect air quality at every moment, automatically change colors and adjust fan speeds based on the air quality it senses. (No remote control) Whisper-Quiet Operation: Sleep mode is awesome for the bedroom with a noise level at 35dB. Set timer to auto shut off to conserve energy while you sleep. Child lock mode makes it can be locked so that not affected by the curious cat, or any children. Separated Filter Replacement Indicator: Replace the single filter when the appropriate filter indicator light starts to flash, not need to replace all filters together as one piece, which helps to save your money. The filter set is available for purchase (Search for RP-AP002 Filter).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NhrJhJvQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RENPHO","source_asin":"B07YC75Q5Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-278604","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YC75Q5Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YC75Q5Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
