window.products.push({"id":278912,"name":"Precious Moments 203065 Disney The Little Mermaid with You, I Have It All Bisque Porcelain Figurine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.37,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817xCQq3ILL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"All things are possible when love is your guide! Inspired by Disney’s The Little Mermaid, a young, sea-ravaged Prince Eric lifts his courageous Princess Ariel out of the waves. With a sparkling dress and hair blowing in the wind, this young lady will have you feeling just as you did when you saw the mermaid become human to be with her beloved. Fans of Disney’s The Little Mermaid, as well as Disney collectible gifts in general, will enjoy this endearing figurine. This figurine makes a unique gift for birthdays, holidays, or to surprise someone who loves this Disney Princess. Measuring approximately 5.25”H, this figurine is meticulously sculpted of fine bisque porcelain and is skillfully hand-painted. Inspired by Disney’s iconic characters, classic films, and more, Precious Moments Disney Showcase collections are designed to create wonderful memories and magical moments of connection among Disney fans of all ages. For more than 40 years, Precious Moments has been devoted to making the world a kinder place by helping people share love. A timeless brand, Precious Moments helps you celebrate everyday moments and commemorate special occasions with hand-painted porcelain figurines and ornaments as well as contemporary kitchenware, home décor, baby gifts, and more. A unique inspirational message lies at the heart of every Precious Moments product, thoughtfully designed so you can turn your special moments into memories that last a lifetime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817xCQq3ILL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Precious Moments","source_asin":"B08VX316KX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-278912","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VX316KX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VX316KX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":278913,"name":"Table Top V Cutter Mesa Chabeta High Gloss Rose Wood with Gold Trim","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZJhZx45kL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Mesa Chabeta table top V cutter has a stainless steel guillotine, a high gloss rose wood body and handle, and a gold cutting mechanism, tray and trim. Mesa Chabeta is traditional, elegant and works as expected every time. This V type cigar cutter is an atypical accessory for the cigar aficionado. The V-cut style cutter sits nicely in the wood base so it can get a clean cut every time. Accented with a gold tray, the high gloss rose wood finish is the ultimate compliment to this cutter. After the cut the blade locks into place so the handle stays down and safe. The cut tobacco falls into the tray so you never make a mess. This table top V cutter looks great on any table or desk and safely locks the blade when not in use. Just press the lock button and you're ready to cut a cigar again. This cigar cutter is the perfect accessory for the cigar smoker and is a great conversation piece that will bring compliments. Mesa Chabeta table top V cutters are 4 3/4 inches wide, 6 1/2 inches long and 5 1/2 inch high. It comes in a box. This unique table top V cigar cutter is made with a surgical grade Stainless Steel guillotine blade that cuts with exact precision. Cutting your cigars correctly means you will have a better tasting smoke, so do it right. The object of the cut is to create an ample and smooth opening for smoking. This allows you to draw evenly, which in turn creates an even burn. These cutters are made to function exactly as expected every time and are fully backed by a full one-year guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZJhZx45kL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuban Crafters","source_asin":"B00AYRGUI0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-278913","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AYRGUI0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AYRGUI0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
